---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Transparency & Institutional Policies | UKABCS">
  <section class="page-header py-20 text-center">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="badge-pill badge-emerald">Open Governance</span>
      <h1 class="page-title mt-4">Transparency &amp; Statutory Policies</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Transparency, accountability, and rigorous ethical standards sit at the very core of UKABCS. Explore our operational frameworks and governance rules.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Policies Grid -->
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="container max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="grid-2 gap-8">
        <!-- Policy 1 -->
        <div class="flat-surface p-8">
          <span class="badge-pill mb-3">Funding Rules</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Grant-Making Policy</h2>
          <p class="text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Sets a fair, meritocratic, and double-blind peer-review framework for evaluating every proposal. Prevents personal bias, guarantees feedback for unsuccessful applicants, and ensures 100% of awarded funds directly target scientific milestones.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Policy 2 -->
        <div class="flat-surface p-8">
          <span class="badge-pill mb-3">Integrity</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Due Diligence Policy</h2>
          <p class="text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Ensures all grant applicants, host universities, and industry partners undergo rigorous vetting regarding academic standing, ethical clearance, financial solvency, and anti-fraud verification before signing grant agreements.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Policy 3 -->
        <div class="flat-surface p-8">
          <span class="badge-pill mb-3">Impartiality</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Conflict of Interest (COI) Policy</h2>
          <p class="text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Mandates full annual disclosure of financial or institutional affiliations for all Trustees, committee panelists, and reviewers. Any reviewer with institutional or co-authorship ties to an applicant must recuse themselves immediately.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Policy 4 -->
        <div class="flat-surface p-8">
          <span class="badge-pill mb-3">Fiduciary</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Financial Governance &amp; Auditing</h2>
          <p class="text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
            All bank accounts, cash donations, and in-kind credit allocations are reconciled quarterly under dual-signatory controls overseen by the Audit &amp; Finance Committee. Independent external audits are submitted annually to UK authorities.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Policy 5 -->
        <div class="flat-surface p-8">
          <span class="badge-pill badge-emerald mb-3">Inclusion</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Equality, Diversity &amp; Inclusion (EDI)</h2>
          <p class="text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Enforces equitable access across gender, geographic region, and career stage. Protects underrepresented scientists, providing dedicated streams for women researchers and scientists from low- and middle-income countries.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Policy 6 -->
        <div class="flat-surface p-8">
          <span class="badge-pill mb-3">Data Privacy</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">GDPR &amp; Data Protection</h2>
          <p class="text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Strict compliance with the UK General Data Protection Regulation (UK GDPR) and Data Protection Act 2018. Applicant proposals, scientific data, and personal details are encrypted at rest and never shared with commercial third parties.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .py-20 { padding-top: 5rem; padding-bottom: 5rem; }
  .py-16 { padding-top: 4rem; padding-bottom: 4rem; }
  .text-center { text-align: center; }
  .mx-auto { margin-inline: auto; }
  .max-w-3xl { max-width: 48rem; }
  .max-w-5xl { max-width: 64rem; }
  .grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .gap-8 { gap: 2rem; }
  .p-8 { padding: 2rem; }
  .mt-4 { margin-top: 1rem; }
  .mb-3 { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .text-xl { font-size: 1.25rem; }
  .text-sm { font-size: 0.875rem; }
  .font-bold { font-weight: 700; }
  .text-secondary { color: var(--color-text-secondary); }
  .leading-relaxed { line-height: 1.7; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .grid-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
